        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Battle of Goldfish Scooping&quot; </strong>is an asymmetrical multiplayer action game inspired by <i>kingyo-sukui</i>, the classic goldfish scooping game from Japanese fairs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scoop with Delicate Skill</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your <i>poi</i>—a fragile paper scoop—to catch goldfish and drop them into the bowl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scoop them one after another to trigger combos and earn bonus points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987080/extras/6c945c398b778bddd31406b9d476ce8e.poster.avif?t=1764253349\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987080/extras/6c945c398b778bddd31406b9d476ce8e.webm?t=1764253349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987080/extras/6c945c398b778bddd31406b9d476ce8e.mp4?t=1764253349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play as a Goldfish and Escape!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a goldfish and dart through the water to avoid the poi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect glowing orbs to raise your score—and even if you’re scooped up, bounce your way to freedom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987080/extras/77c2ebc217f5004b27fbe6ca01e08f62.poster.avif?t=1764253349\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987080/extras/77c2ebc217f5004b27fbe6ca01e08f62.webm?t=1764253349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987080/extras/77c2ebc217f5004b27fbe6ca01e08f62.mp4?t=1764253349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow Stronger Each Time You Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn new skills and boost your stats based on your results after each match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep playing, keep improving, and aim for the high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987080/extras/1aab03c6dd457d0631436247f0a30c91.poster.avif?t=1764253349\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987080/extras/1aab03c6dd457d0631436247f0a30c91.webm?t=1764253349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987080/extras/1aab03c6dd457d0631436247f0a30c91.mp4?t=1764253349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join the Festival Online</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a shared tank with players from around the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful—other players might steal your catch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987080/extras/b11af540695957c567059bb49fe44cd8.poster.avif?t=1764253349\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987080/extras/b11af540695957c567059bb49fe44cd8.webm?t=1764253349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987080/extras/b11af540695957c567059bb49fe44cd8.mp4?t=1764253349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A playful twist on a timeless Japanese festival tradition.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you scoop—or be scooped?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Regarding Streaming and Video Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We welcome gameplay streaming and the posting of gameplay videos for this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no specific restrictions on monetization.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Battle of Goldfish Scooping&quot; </strong>is an asymmetrical multiplayer action game inspired by <i>kingyo-sukui</i>, the classic goldfish scooping game from Japanese fairs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Scoop with Delicate Skill</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your <i>poi</i>—a fragile paper scoop—to catch goldfish and drop them into the bowl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scoop them one after another to trigger combos and earn bonus points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987080/extras/6c945c398b778bddd31406b9d476ce8e.poster.avif?t=1764253349\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987080/extras/6c945c398b778bddd31406b9d476ce8e.webm?t=1764253349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987080/extras/6c945c398b778bddd31406b9d476ce8e.mp4?t=1764253349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play as a Goldfish and Escape!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a goldfish and dart through the water to avoid the poi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect glowing orbs to raise your score—and even if you’re scooped up, bounce your way to freedom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987080/extras/77c2ebc217f5004b27fbe6ca01e08f62.poster.avif?t=1764253349\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987080/extras/77c2ebc217f5004b27fbe6ca01e08f62.webm?t=1764253349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987080/extras/77c2ebc217f5004b27fbe6ca01e08f62.mp4?t=1764253349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow Stronger Each Time You Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn new skills and boost your stats based on your results after each match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep playing, keep improving, and aim for the high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987080/extras/1aab03c6dd457d0631436247f0a30c91.poster.avif?t=1764253349\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987080/extras/1aab03c6dd457d0631436247f0a30c91.webm?t=1764253349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987080/extras/1aab03c6dd457d0631436247f0a30c91.mp4?t=1764253349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join the Festival Online</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a shared tank with players from around the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful—other players might steal your catch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987080/extras/b11af540695957c567059bb49fe44cd8.poster.avif?t=1764253349\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987080/extras/b11af540695957c567059bb49fe44cd8.webm?t=1764253349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2987080/extras/b11af540695957c567059bb49fe44cd8.mp4?t=1764253349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A playful twist on a timeless Japanese festival tradition.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you scoop—or be scooped?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Regarding Streaming and Video Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We welcome gameplay streaming and the posting of gameplay videos for this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no specific restrictions on monetization.</p>",
